$b$, $b$class Solution:
    def combinationSum(self, candidates, target):
        out = []
        def go(i, rem, path):
            if rem == 0:
                out.append(path[:]); return
            if i == len(candidates) or rem < 0:
                return
            path.append(candidates[i]); go(i, rem - candidates[i], path); path.pop()
            go(i + 1, rem, path)
        go(0, target, [])
        return out$b$)
